=== Diagnostic Steps ===

# Reset Controller
#* Press reset button (rear pinhole) for 5–10 seconds
#* Re-test
# Test via USB
#* Connect controller via USB cable
#* Confirm it works in Safe Mode but not in normal mode
# Test Controller on Another System
#* Verify PS5 controller is not at fault
# Confirm Firmware Update
#* Attempt PS5 firmware update
#* If no change → hardware fault likely
# Visual Inspection
#* Inspect PCB for corrosion or damage around RF module

If controller consistently works only in Safe Mode → proceed to module replacement.

=== Repair Steps ===

# Power off System
# Disassemble carefully
# Remove PCB assembly
# Locate BT/WiFi module
# Apply flux
# Remove faulty module with controlled hot air
# Clean pads thoroughly
# Install exact matching replacement module with a new one
# Reflow evenly
# Inspect solder joints under magnification
# Reassemble System